commit dae4c64d
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 15:41:21 -0600
subject: fix(cloudflare-deploy): add 30s fetch timeouts to all Cloudflare API calls

Add AbortSignal.timeout(CLOUDFLARE_API_TIMEOUT_MS) to all three Cloudflare
API fetch calls in the deploy route: worker script upload (PUT), subdomain
enable (POST), and subdomain check (GET). Without timeouts, Cloudflare API
slowness blocked the deploy UI indefinitely with no user feedback.

Fixes GAP-P2-22 from comprehensive scan.

